  "source": "Schneider Electric PowerLogic EM4800 MODBUS Register List, version 2.0 (20 June 2011)",
  "notes": [
    "Schneider Electric PowerLogic EM4800, 3-phase 8-meter configuration (table 1 of the register list: 3P08).",
    "Modbus TCP on port 502 with a fixed unit address of 1. Registers are read-only. 32-bit values (int32 and IEEE float32) are in two consecutive registers, big-endian (B3:B2:B1:B0). Address 0 is 40001.",
    "The register list gives each value a 'radix' column (10, or 16 for the model registers); no scaling factor is stated, so values are the raw numbers.",
    "The list has two more tables, for the 12 two-pole (2P12) and 24 one-pole (1P24) configurations, with different layouts; they are not in this map. Interval data needs firmware manufacturing build 1053 or higher.",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
